# The vendored devbin runtime is not this project's to format (Devbin issue
# 0008): a formatting hook that rewrites bin/.devbin/lib/ does so inside an
# install/upgrade commit and breaks the vendored manifest one doctor later.
#
# This project's hook is the raw-prettier shape rather than the fleet's, so the
# fence was proven here before the install: without it a probe .md under
# bin/.devbin/lib/ came back rewritten; with it, byte-identical, while a project
# .md staged alongside was still formatted normally.
bin/.devbin/lib/
